Policy.Check returns *limits.Exceeded bare and wrapped by "daily budget of %s: %w"; Exceeded.Unwrap
returns the sentinel domain.ErrLimitExceeded (constant Unwrap, not a field).
Expect ErrLimitExceeded reachable behind (*Exceeded).Unwrap (with and without the errorf wrap) and
nothing else; the two &Exceeded{} literals are the wrappers.
